          "adaptation": "保留圆角有厚度素材框、cubic-out展开收至证据位，解除原产品和原坐标绑定。"
        },
        {
          "path": "assets/editing-kit/editing-kit.js",
          "symbol": "resultPullback / occlusionReveal",
          "adaptation": "Existing smooth progress and rectangle-to-transform math, actually applied to Canvas transforms and clips."
